      "uid": "zhcn:12d950b8200162ae6e20030f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我偶然路过训练跑道时，不经意间注意到无声铃鹿正在跑道上奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded6d682b60696f95efa9a59dd438118cc629e7c319c53527df86001e5d3f270",
